{
    "title": "Ayar-Chat&Play",
    "description": "Do you want to have a live video chat with people from all over the world?\u200b\r\nAyar is the app you are looking for.\r\nAyar will connect you with millions of people from over 100 countries. Live video chat with real people for a unique experience and meet new people from different cultures.\r\nYou can enjoy:\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fMore People You Like:\r\nAyar has an advanced artificial intelligence matching algorithm. Recommend someone you like more.\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0f100% Real Person:\r\nAyar will not have any bots, all users will be real people.\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fPrivacy Protection:\r\nAyar prohibits video recording and screenshots to protect your privacy\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fShorter Waiting Time:\r\nEach random video match takes only 2s on average, so you no longer have to wait\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fFree Real-time Translation:\r\nBoth video chat and text chat support real-time free translation in hundreds of languages around the world\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fCustomized Functions:\r\nNot only can you choose a region, but you can also choose people with 100% real photos and videos. Get a different video experience\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fFree Beauty Camera\r\nAyar will automatically use beauty features for you to make you more attractive. You can also choose the effect that suits you best.\r\n\r\nIf you also want to experience live video chat with people and experience a different video chat, Ayar is the right choice for you, start now~",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you want to have a live video chat with people from all over the world?\u200b<br>Ayar is the app you are looking for.<br>Ayar will connect you with millions of people from over 100 countries. Live video chat with real people for a unique experience and meet new people from different cultures.<br>You can enjoy:<br><br>\u2764\ufe0fMore People You Like:<br>Ayar has an advanced artificial intelligence matching algorithm. Recommend someone you like more.<br><br>\u2764\ufe0f100% Real Person:<br>Ayar will not have any bots, all users will be real people.<br><br>\u2764\ufe0fPrivacy Protection:<br>Ayar prohibits video recording and screenshots to protect your privacy<br><br>\u2764\ufe0fShorter Waiting Time:<br>Each random video match takes only 2s on average, so you no longer have to wait<br><br>\u2764\ufe0fFree Real-time Translation:<br>Both video chat and text chat support real-time free translation in hundreds of languages around the world<br><br>\u2764\ufe0fCustomized Functions:<br>Not only can you choose a region, but you can also choose people with 100% real photos and videos. Get a different video experience<br><br>\u2764\ufe0fFree Beauty Camera<br>Ayar will automatically use beauty features for you to make you more attractive. You can also choose the effect that suits you best.<br><br>If you also want to experience live video chat with people and experience a different video chat, Ayar is the right choice for you, start now~",
